{"id":"256972a0a3503007","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-hechler-condition.md","title":"ZFC Hechler Condition","display":"df-zfc-hechler-condition — ZFC Hechler Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-hechler-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-hechler-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-hechler-condition — ZFC Hechler Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-hechler-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-hechler-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-hechler-condition — ZFC Hechler Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,s,f \\in V\">\\(p,s,f \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HechlerCondition}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{HechlerCondition}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hechler\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{HechlerCondition}_S(p,s,f) \\leftrightarrow p=\\langle s,f\\rangle\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hechler\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{HechlerCondition}_S(p,s,f) \\leftrightarrow p=\\langle s,f\\rangle\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The finite stem <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> and eventual lower-bound function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> are separate components of a Hechler condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,s,f \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HechlerCondition}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hechler\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{HechlerCondition}_S(p,s,f) \\leftrightarrow p=\\langle s,f\\rangle\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":757,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-hechler-condition.md|58-df-zfc-hechler-condition]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}